{
 "meta": {
  "pack": "PIVOT Supplemental MVP Pack v1",
  "workout_count": 20,
  "format": "canonical-v1",
  "_type_ruling": "Authored as short_metcon/mobility/stretching, which are not in migration 0013's vocabulary. Product ruling 2026-09-01: short_metcon -> metcon, mobility and stretching -> recovery. No new enum value. The authored value is kept on each workout as authored_supplemental_type.",
  "_routine_steps": "Mobility and stretch movements are ordinary content.exercises rows with an empty strength ontology (scripts/import-mobility-vocabulary.mjs), so block_exercises.exercise_id stays the single content reference model. No second persistence shape, and no invented progression metadata.",
  "_emom": "An EMOM is rounds of one-minute work, which workout_blocks already expresses \u2014 wo_hyrox_density_emom_20 is the precedent. The minute clock is block structure; rounds are the authored minutes divided by the movement count, which divides exactly for all six. Nothing stays embedded in a dose string.",
  "_derived": "workout_family, intensity_target, impact_level and hyrox_specificity were absent and are stated explicitly per supplemental_type rather than defaulted; the RPE targets come from the authoring notes (\"RPE cap 6\", \"stop well before failure\"). `stimulus` is the authored `focus`, verbatim.",
  "default_description": "Optional supplemental work.",
  "default_coaching_notes": "Optional. Skip it freely; nothing is pending if you do.",
  "express_rule": "drop the last movement; never shorten the rest",
  "micro_rule": "the first movement only"
 },
